The Android build includes the android-smsmms transport maintained by the
QUIK project for carrier MMS sending. Its source and GPL-3.0 license are
bundled under tool/vendor/android-smsmms.

BlueBubbles does not include Apple services, iMessage protocol code, or Apple
authentication code. SMS and MMS are handled locally through Android's
telephony providers and the user's mobile carrier.
